            "privacy_main_html": "\n            <section class=\"content-section\">\n                <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"legal-grid\">\n                        <aside class=\"sidebar-card\">\n                            <h4>Is Page Par</h4>\n                            <ul class=\"sidebar-menu\">\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-1\" class=\"sidebar-link active\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info\"></i> 1. Is Website Ke Baare Mein</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-2\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-check\"></i> 2. Aapki Share Ki Gayi Information</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-3\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-gear\"></i> 3. Information Ka Use Kaise Hota Hai</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-4\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-simple\"></i> 4. Analytics Aur Tracking</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-5\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-share-nodes\"></i> 5. Information Sharing</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-6\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-briefcase\"></i> 6. Client Ka Data Aur Materials</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-7\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-lock\"></i> 7. Security Aur Protection</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-8\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-link\"></i> 8. Third-Party Links</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-9\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen-to-square\"></i> 9. Policy Updates</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#p-10\" class=\"sidebar-link\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-envelope\"></i> 10. Contact Details</a></li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </aside>\n\n                        <article class=\"legal-content-card\">\n                            <div class=\"last-updated-badge\">\n                                <i class=\"fa-regular fa-clock\"></i> Last Updated: 11 August 2026\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-1\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info\"></i><h3>1. Is Website Ke Baare Mein</h3></div>\n                                <p>Munendra Singh – Web Developer par aapka welcome hai.</p>\n                                <p>Ye website mere web development work ko showcase karne aur website design v development services ki information provide karne ke liye banayi gayi hai.</p>\n                                <p>Aapki privacy mere liye bohot important hai aur mera aim aapke data ko simple aur transparent rakhna hai.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-2\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-check\"></i><h3>2. Aapki Share Ki Gayi Information</h3></div>\n                                <p>Is website par koi mandatory registration ya unnecessary data collection form use nahi hota.</p>\n                                <p>Jab aap WhatsApp, email ya call ke through contact karte hain, to aap voluntarily apna naam, contact info, business requirements, photos ya logos share karte hain.</p>\n                                <p>Hum sirf wahi information receive karte hain jo aap khud share karna choose karte hain.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-3\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-gear\"></i><h3>3. Information Ka Use Kaise Hota Hai</h3></div>\n                                <p>Aapki information ka use following purposes ke liye hota hai:</p>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>Aapke project requirements ko samajhne ke liye</li>\n                                    <li>Aapki inquiry ka response dene ke liye</li>\n                                    <li>Website design aur delivery complete karne ke liye</li>\n                                    <li>Project communication aur technical support ke liye</li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <p>Hum aapka data kisi unrelated purpose ke liye use nahi karte.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-simple\"></i><h3>4. Analytics Aur Tracking</h3></div>\n                                <p>Currently hum is website par koi third-party tracking tools ya invasive analytics use nahi karte.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-5\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-share-nodes\"></i><h3>5. Information Sharing</h3></div>\n                                <p>Hum aapki personal information kisi ko bhi sell ya rent nahi karte.</p>\n                                <p>Agar project ke liye domain ya hosting service setup karni ho to required limit tak hi data use hota hai.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-6\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-briefcase\"></i><h3>6. Client Ka Data Aur Materials</h3></div>\n                                <p>Aapke dwara provide kiye gaye business details, photos aur logos sirf aapke agreed project ke liye use hote hain.</p>\n                                <p>Portfolio me showcase karne se pehle aapse proper permission li jaati hai.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-7\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-lock\"></i><h3>7. Security Aur Protection</h3></div>\n                                <p>Hum aapke shared information ki security ke liye standard care maintain karte hain.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-8\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-link\"></i><h3>8. Third-Party Links</h3></div>\n                                <p>Website par WhatsApp, LinkedIn ya GitHub ke links hain jinpar unki apni privacy terms apply hoti hain.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-9\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen-to-square\"></i><h3>9. Policy Updates</h3></div>\n                                <p>Future updates isi page par publish kiye jaayenge.</p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"policy-item\" id=\"p-10\">\n                                <div class=\"policy-header\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-envelope\"></i><h3>10. Contact Details</h3></div>\n                                <p>Privacy policy ke regarding kisi bhi sawaal ke liye direct connect karein:</p>\n                                <p><strong>Munendra Singh</strong><br>Web Developer<br>India</p>\n                                <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:singh2005munendra@gmail.com\" style=\"color: #2563eb;\">singh2005munendra@gmail.com</a><br>WhatsApp: <a href=\"https://wa.me/919105523282\" style=\"color: #2563eb;\">9105523282</a></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n",
